"""semsearchd: local semantic search for the Semantic search Omarchy plugin.

Indexes documents (as passages) and images, embeds them with EmbeddingGemma 2
through a llama-server it starts on demand, and answers JSON-lines requests on
a unix socket. Ranking fuses SQLite FTS5 (the literal words, in the text or the
file path) with cosine similarity (the meaning, or what a picture shows).
"""

